{"skill":{"slug":"acuity-scheduling","displayName":"acuity-scheduling"},"version":{"version":"1.2.6","createdAt":1790935787546,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":56815,"sha256":"0ec2d66cc0a288206fc8a7b341542ca5aa42ad4cb5f821d86b7be592ac18cb5c","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/calendly/triggers.md","size":10281,"sha256":"ae92dbfb6dd4caf628900b293d1b3c6e7d5e70cf7f6a9397407594daf50d4a48","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/github/triggers.md","size":61142,"sha256":"7424d3be38ec400eb8a4b0a6a94a94eeec40208c0bcee29a61caa5da48eea7f4","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/google-mail/triggers.md","size":2648,"sha256":"5cc5065cd7db33dc33715675bbb0ee29ed49657ad9ad4354aebd1a9efdf8d8f3","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/hubspot/triggers.md","size":8298,"sha256":"439d56e4d02e119e1de3caf79a0334243ae70c583a3e15847831c396f39c2837","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/linear/triggers.md","size":7270,"sha256":"641f6496f50e09faab921ef4c06f725122b798cb034e9f0dfaf9f838074ab377","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/notion/triggers.md","size":5840,"sha256":"fdaf3840d8213dbd7549426c1166f94cc94b09e022a1611ef2dad6f36db2f969","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/slack/triggers.md","size":6181,"sha256":"b5ee099a215223a7e5186c41a0d13fc1de68e977719304c509df105843d81f38","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/stripe/triggers.md","size":25651,"sha256":"ae091545396a376c7ecfe09e94b46b7bbb44fd8a72ea954bcc1239052b7959f0","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/time/triggers.md","size":1140,"sha256":"b8f5a523501f8d03e11e58f6426cd96b54ba0c66c8983b57c0ea31386b309e01","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2254,"sha256":"573799196a11cadcb2990947079928567a00f130e9835def10b80452375d64a3","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1790936290344,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"012e29a7681936e8bbc39e642bb7c9c592f53b9657c287fcdef94a708b3b85c7","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/012e29a7681936e8bbc39e642bb7c9c592f53b9657c287fcdef94a708b3b85c7","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1790936107581},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":0,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":0,"checkedAt":1790936290344},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"The skill is a disclosed Acuity Scheduling integration, with expected account access and automation features that require user approval.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Network access, Bash use, and OAuth credentials are proportionate to an API integration; the artifact warns not to inspect or expose stored credentials and to prefer the CLI credential flow over long-lived API keys.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Installation is disclosed as a pinned Maton CLI install via npm or Homebrew, with optional SDK installs and a raw HTTPS fallback only when the CLI cannot be used.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill includes broad Maton platform reference sections for functions, triggers, destinations, and other event sources, but repeatedly scopes them to user-requested automation and requires explicit approval for writes, connections, deployments, and persistent forwarding.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill can create OAuth connections, hosted functions, triggers, and persistent destinations, but these behaviors are clearly documented with user-approval, least-privilege, network-policy, and deletion guidance.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The documented capabilities match the stated purpose: access Acuity Scheduling through Maton OAuth to read and manage appointments, calendars, clients, availability, blocks, and related scheduling data.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install only if you intend to let Maton access your Acuity Scheduling account. Approve the OAuth connection deliberately, review every create/update/delete action before it runs, and be especially careful with hosted functions, triggers, or destination URLs because they can run or forward data continuously until removed.","findings":null,"agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1790936290344}}}}}